{"unit_id": "tag:07R3:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme）。称<MATH_0002>具有<TEXTITOPEN_0001>J-2性质（J-2）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，条件是对每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，若其为局部有限型（locally of finite type），则正则点集（regular locus）<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>中是开（open）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "J-2", "target_term": "J-2性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "regular locus", "target_term": "正则点集"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "限定定义所适用的概形。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义所讨论的对象。"}, {"source_term": "J-2", "target_term": "J-2性质", "context": "本条定义的性质，保留原符号。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定义中全称量化的对象。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "限定全称量化所涉及的态射。"}, {"source_term": "regular locus", "target_term": "正则点集", "context": "定义中要求为开的点集。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "正则点集在相应概形中须满足的拓扑条件。"}], "notes": []}
